  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SELAM &#xbf; Early Recovery and Socio-Economic Stability of Conflict Affected Populations in Tigray, Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;CARE, in collaboration with REST, propose a comprehensive intervention &#xbf;to strengthen the capacities of conflict affected communities, households, and individuals in Tigray region, in particular women and girls, to recover their livelihoods and build back better&#xbf;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
